  "read_at_that_time": "All readouts of the original stress ladder on nested (stress_test/results.md). The scale_A lane headline: B AnchorBoost 914/84/12,031, measured-only 818/75/13,503, saving 10.90% [7.67, 14.23]; A 925/83/11,851 and 822/78/13,443; lane lambdas equal to the no-lane lambdas in every fold. Published common_scale R1 test decisions: 583 (B) and 585 (A) of 965 test designs have measured_only >= 3, all reference-active; 58.9% (B) and 59.2% (A) of the remaining designs are inactive. Training-only inputs: per-output residual scales (fold medians 1.70-1.76, range 0.74-2.84), AnchorBoost cutoffs 2.67-3.01 and rank-reference maxima 10.03-11.17. No corrupted rung of either arm had been computed.",
