    "added": "lane_test and lane_cal (designs in the lane), nonlane_reports and cal_nonlane_reports (released designs outside the lane), cal_releases_nothing = calibration releases no design outside the lane, the paired well saving against measured-only cost_savings = 1 - sum wells_used / sum measured-only wells_used, and the rank-ceiling counts among calibration designs outside the lane (cal_nonlane_rows, cal_nonlane_above_reference_max, cal_nonlane_inactive_above_reference_max) next to the parent counts over all calibration designs.",
